\\text{Var}[Y] & =\\text{E}[{Y}^{2}]-\\text{E}[Y]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{15}-{(\\frac{5}{8})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{73}{960}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, let's find $\\textrm{Cov}[X,Y].$ Using the given results, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}[X,Y] & =\\text{E}[XY]-\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y] \\\\  & =\\frac{17}{48}-(\\frac{7}{12})\\cdot (\\frac{5}{8}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{96}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the covariance matrix is given by\n\n![](images/a1/a16a9b39d5ff75935e7394d1ff0f3eb03437bc000038b20925d1f91985386b48.svg)" 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188296 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548000 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188327 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548070 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188328 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548046 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188355 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548023 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188355 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548026 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188355 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548054 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188355 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548064 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188355 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548074 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188362 1038 #edb/ref 17592186547993 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188362 1038 #edb/ref 17592186547998 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188362 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548011 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188362 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548042 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188362 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548077 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188363 1038 #edb/ref 17592186547991 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188363 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548018 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188363 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548053 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188363 1038 #edb/ref 17592186548072 13194139535953 17592186045417 true] [17592186188364 1038 #edb/ref 17592186